---
import allSteps from '../../data/learning-path.json';
interface Props{steps?:typeof allSteps}
const{steps=allSteps}=Astro.props;
import {layoutPath} from '../../lib/path-layout.mjs';
import {routePathEdges} from '../../lib/path-routing.mjs';
type PathNode=(typeof steps)[number]&{rank:number;x:number;y:number;width:number;height:number};
const data=layoutPath(steps) as {width:number;height:number;nodes:PathNode[];edges:{source:string;target:string}[];lanes:{id:string;en:string;zh:string;x:number;y:number;width:number;height:number}[]};const routed=routePathEdges(data) as {source:string;target:string;d:string}[];const byId=new Map(data.nodes.map(n=>[n.id,n]));
function lines(text:string,max=22){const words=text.split(' ');const out:string[]=[];let line='';for(const w of words){if(line&&(line+' '+w).length>max){out.push(line);line=w;}else line=line?line+' '+w:w;}if(line)out.push(line);return out;}
---
<section class="path-map" id="path-overview" data-path-graph aria-labelledby="path-map-title">
<header class="path-map-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">CURRICULUM GRAPH · 课程关系图</span><h2 id="path-map-title">See the whole path.<small>看清顺序，也看清选择。</small></h2><p>→ Prerequisite · 箭头表示前置；不同分支可以选择。</p></div><span class="graph-counter">{data.nodes.length} checkpoints<br/>{data.lanes.length} learning tracks</span></header>
<div class="path-graph-toolbar"><label>Find a topic · 查找主题<input type="search" data-path-graph-search placeholder="Transformer / 线性代数 / RAG…"/></label><details class="path-options"><summary>Filters & help · 筛选与帮助</summary><div class="path-options-body"><label>Learning track · 学习方向<select data-path-graph-lane><option value="">All tracks · 全部方向</option>{data.lanes.map(l=><option value={l.id}>{l.en} · {l.zh}</option>)}</select></label><label>View · 显示范围<select data-path-graph-view><option value="all">Full overview · 全图</option><option value="route">Prerequisites · 当前节点的前置链</option><option value="available">Available · 当前可开始</option><option value="progress">My progress · 已覆盖</option></select></label></div><p>拖动平移；Ctrl/⌘ + 滚轮缩放。同列可以并行；多个前置箭头汇入时需全部覆盖。</p></details></div>
<div class="path-graph-actions"><button type="button" data-path-camera="out" aria-label="Zoom out · 缩小">−</button><output data-path-camera-scale>100%</output><button type="button" data-path-camera="in" aria-label="Zoom in · 放大">＋</button><button type="button" data-path-camera="focus" disabled>Focus · 放大所选</button><button type="button" data-path-camera="start">Quick start · 聚焦起步</button><button type="button" data-path-camera="fit">Fit all · 回到全图</button><button type="button" data-path-camera="full">Full screen · 全屏</button></div>
<div class="path-graph-workspace"><div class="path-graph-stage"><svg class="curriculum-svg" data-path-svg viewBox={`0 0 ${data.width} ${data.height}`} role="group" tabindex="0" aria-label="Course prerequisite graph · 课程前置关系全图，节点可用键盘选择">
<defs><marker id="path-prereq-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10Z"/></marker></defs><rect class="path-background" width={data.width} height={data.height}/>
<text x="20" y="35" class="path-axis-title">Learning progression → 学习递进</text><text x="20" y="62" class="path-axis-note">Branches are choices · 分支可以选择；横距不表示耗时，同列不表示难度相同</text>
{data.lanes.map(l=><g class="path-lane"><rect x={l.x} y={l.y} width={l.width} height={l.height} rx="8"/><text x="28" y={l.y+37}>{l.en.length>20?l.en.split(' & ')[0]:l.en}</text>{l.en.length>20&&l.en.includes(' & ')&&<text x="28" y={l.y+59}>{'& '+l.en.split(' & ')[1]}</text>}<text x="28" y={l.y+(l.en.length>20&&l.en.includes(' & ')?81:61)} class="path-lane-zh">{l.zh}</text></g>)}
<g class="path-connections">{routed.map(e=><g data-path-edge-source={e.source} data-path-edge-target={e.target}><path d={e.d} marker-end="url(#path-prereq-arrow)"/><title>Prerequisite · 前置：{byId.get(e.source)!.titleEn} → {byId.get(e.target)!.titleEn}</title></g>)}</g>
{data.nodes.map(n=><g role="button" tabindex="0" class="path-graph-node" data-path-node={n.id} data-route-point={n.id} transform={`translate(${n.x},${n.y})`} aria-label={`${n.titleEn} · ${n.titleZh}，打开资料与前置关系`}><rect width={n.width} height={n.height} rx="8"/><circle cx={n.width-12} cy="12" r="4" class="path-state-dot"/><text x="11" y="23" class="path-node-en">{lines(n.titleEn).map((line,i)=><tspan x="11" dy={i?19:0}>{line}</tspan>)}</text><text x="11" y="59" class="path-node-zh">{n.titleZh}</text><text x="11" y="73" class="path-node-meta">{n.minutes} min · {n.optional?'Optional':'Reading'}<tspan x={n.width-11} text-anchor="end" data-path-node-status>Not started</tspan></text><title>{n.title} · {n.materials.map(m=>m.label).join(' / ')} · 选读约 {n.minutes} 分钟</title></g>)}
</svg>
<div class="path-mini" data-path-mini-panel><div><button type="button" data-path-mini-drag aria-label="Move minimap · 拖动导航小地图，方向键移动，Home 复位">⠿ Overview · 全局导航</button><button type="button" data-path-mini-toggle aria-expanded="true" aria-label="Collapse minimap · 折叠导航小地图">−</button></div><svg data-path-mini viewBox={`0 0 ${data.width} ${data.height}`} role="group" tabindex="0" aria-label="点击小地图定位，方向键平移，Home 返回全图"><rect class="path-background" width={data.width} height={data.height}/>{data.lanes.map(l=><rect class="path-mini-lane" x={l.x} y={l.y} width={l.width} height={l.height}/>)}{data.nodes.map(n=><rect data-path-mini-node={n.id} x={n.x} y={n.y} width={n.width} height={n.height} rx="4"/>)}<rect class="path-mini-viewport" data-path-mini-viewport x="0" y="0" width={data.width} height={data.height}/></svg></div></div>
<aside class="path-graph-detail" data-path-detail><span class="eyebrow">NEXT ACTION · 下一步</span><h3>Prediction Tasks</h3><p>预测任务 · 先从一个输入和输出开始。</p><a class="button" href="#level-first-step">Open checkpoint · 打开第一关 →</a><p class="tiny">点击图中节点，查看原作者资料、前置要求与可继续选择的分支。</p></aside></div>
<div class="path-graph-footer"><p data-path-graph-status role="status">Full overview · {data.nodes.length} 个选读关卡，所有资料始终可打开。</p><details><summary>Legend · 图例</summary><div class="path-graph-legend"><span>→ Prerequisite · 前置</span><span>○ Not started · 未开始</span><span>◉ Available · 可开始</span><span>✓ Covered · 已覆盖</span></div></details></div>
<script type="application/json" data-path-layout set:html={JSON.stringify(data).replace(/</g,'\u003c')}/>
<noscript><p>可直接阅读二维全图。下方列表提供全部原始资料与前置要求；互动缩放与记录需要 JavaScript。</p></noscript>
</section>
